{"key":"aa22243e719a5f4a26353bb06141f7d6445679716be5a47d30ea06dc4e858c34","quote":"When the guest wants to book, ask for the name, dates and number of guests before anything else.","text":"{\"limits\": []}","usage":{"input":404,"output":9}}
